WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.800
Welcome to RigPi! I’m Howard, W6HN.

00:03.800 --> 00:10.600
Ask Elmer can answer your amateur-radio questions, help troubleshoot your station, and guide you through RigPi.

00:10.600 --> 00:17.500
Elmer Control can even operate your radio—with your confirmation before any important action.

00:17.500 --> 00:24.900
Whether you’re new to ham radio or an old hand, Elmer is here to help. Let’s get started!
